cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
order.1	1	converter	convert					sheets are written in the order of the schema's tree, the sheet of instances last
order.2	1	converter	convert					records are written in the order the input holds them, never sorted
order.3	1	converter	convert					the key columns come first, then the simple domains in the order the schema writes them
arguments
